<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Dressify Verification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 480px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #eee;
            padding: 32px;
        }

        .code {
            font-size: 2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 10px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 16px 0;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        .privacy {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        .footer-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center; /* vertically center items */
            gap: 16px; /* space between columns */
            flex-wrap: wrap; /* wrap on small screens */
        }

        .footer-column {
            /* optional common styles for columns */
        }

        .logo-column {
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            margin-right: 20px; /* size to content */
        }

        .logo {
            max-height: 50px; /* adjust logo size as needed */
            height: auto;
            width: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .text-column {
            flex: 1 1 0; /* take remaining space */
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #555;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h2>Log in to Dressify</h2>
    <p>Welcome back! Enter this code to log in:</p>
    <div class="code"><%= code; %></div>
    <div class="footer">
        You’re receiving this email because you have a Dressify account. This email is not a marketing or
        promotional email. This is why this email does not contain an unsubscribe link. You will receive this email even if you have
        unsubscribed from Dressify ’s marketing emails.
    </div>
    <div class="footer-row" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <div class="footer-column logo-column">
            <img class="logo"
                 src="https://dwvyz5991jfbh.cloudfront.net/app_data/0981688a-fae8-4e8c-9c0a-730b0f2bce36.png"
                 alt="Logo" />
        </div>
        <div class="footer-column text-column">
            Dressify, AI powered shopping platform..<br>
            +94-344-6696 | <span class="privacy">Privacy Policy</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
